== Effects ==
Upon use, it:
* Rerolls all passive items on Isaac (like the {{i|D4}}).
* Rerolls all pedestal items in the [[room]] (like {{i|The D6}}).
* Rerolls all pickups in the room (like the {{i|D20}}).
* {{dlc+|r}} Restarts the room and respawns all enemies (like the {{i|D7}}).{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Rerolls Isaac's [[damage]], [[tears]], [[range]] and [[speed]] (like the {{i|D8}}).{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Rerolls all enemies in the room into weaker ones (like the {{i|D10}}).
** Doesn't go into effect in rooms the {{i|D7}} works in.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Rerolls all rocks in the room (like the {{i|D12}}).{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Duplicates 1 random pickup in the current room (like the {{i|D1}}).{{dlc-}}
** The pickup is rerolled by the {{i|D20}} before being duplicated, essentially just granting a random extra pickup.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} D100 is a [[special item]].
* {{Dlc|nr}} See the {{i|D4}}, {{i|The D6}}, and the {{i|D20}} to learn more about the respective individual effects.
* {{Dlc|r}} See the {{i|D1|dlc=n}}, {{i|D4}}, {{i|The D6}}, {{i|D7|dlc=n}}, {{i|D8|dlc=n}}, {{i|D10}}, {{i|D12|dlc=n}}, and the {{i|D20}} to learn more about the respective individual effects.
* If Missing No. is given to the player, it will activate and remove the D100, preventing further rerolls.
** Note that {{i|Missing No.}} can be rerolled into, but can't be rerolled out of.
* {{dlc+|r+}} D100's quality is treated as 2 for the purposes of {{I|Bag of Crafting}}.{{dlc-}}

